{"id":"stockholm-boat-80x-nacka-strand","group":"stockholm-boat-80x","city":"Stockholm","mode":"boat","line":"80X","vehicle":"båt","vehicleLong":"båt","operator":"SL","api":"sl","tab":"","guide":null,"speedKmh":20,"dwellSec":60,"route":[[59.33206,18.076519],[59.326832,18.088983],[59.318738,18.096728],[59.318073,18.114805],[59.318363,18.133501],[59.318713,18.139161],[59.31847,18.158036],[59.318333,18.158909]],"stops":[{"name":"Nybroplan","lat":59.33206,"lon":18.076519,"story":"Välkommen ombord på båt 80X mot Nacka strand! Resan tar ungefär 18 minuter. Vid Nybroplan ligger Dramaten, Kungliga Dramatiska teatern, invigd 1908. Härifrån börjar Strandvägen, med sina pampiga sekelskifteshus längs vattnet, och från Nybrokajen går båtar ut i skärgården.","tips":[["Strandvägen, promenad längs vattnet","2 min"],["Båtar från Nybrokajen","2 min"]],"dur":18.4,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg/1280px-Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Алексей Решетников","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Norrmalm,_Stockholm,_Sweden_-_panoramio_(41).jpg","title":"Norrmalm, Stockholm, Sweden","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg/1280px-Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"randreu","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_(23).jpg","title":"Sweden - Stockholm","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab","title":"Nybroplan/Birgerjarlsgatan, Stockholm City","old":true,"year":1966,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a","title":"Nybroplan mot Hötorgscity - City","old":true,"year":1967,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/2c8bb7023b12ad5d.mp3"},{"name":"Nacka strand","lat":59.318333,"lon":18.158909,"story":"Snart är vi framme vid ändhållplatsen Nacka strand. Nacka strand hette länge Augustendal. 1899 köpte industripionjären J.V. Svensson området och skapade 500 jobb i verkstadsindustrin. Under en lågkonjunktur på 1920-talet gick han i konkurs. På 1980-talet byggdes kontor och bostäder, och 1988 fick området namnet Nacka strand. Vid årsskiftet 2024–2025 öppnade kocken Pontus Frithiof restaurangen Fabriken här. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[],"dur":31.1,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg/1280px-Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Ankara","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg","title":"M/s Ballerina outside Nacka strand.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG/1280px-PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Patrik Nylin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG","title":"Polisbåt av typen Stridsbåt 90H vid Nacka Strand","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg/1280px-GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Patrik Nylin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg","title":"m/s Gurli utanför Nacka Strand, Stockholm 3 april 2014. Byggd 1871 vid Bergsunds Mek Verkstad som Ny","near":true}],"audio":"audio/piper/ded8ac5376e5a02b.mp3"}],"looks":[{"id":"vasamuseet","lat":59.328,"lon":18.0914,"r":220,"text":"Till vänster ser du Vasamuseets tak, med masterna som visar hur högt skeppet Vasa är.","dur":6.2,"audio":"audio/piper/c11bfaa07b8631f1.mp3"},{"id":"gronalund","lat":59.3233,"lon":18.0966,"r":260,"text":"Till vänster ligger Gröna Lund, Sveriges äldsta nöjespark.","dur":4.5,"audio":"audio/piper/f3e552f5474f7ef0.mp3"}],"from":"Nybroplan","to":"Nacka strand","variant":"Mot Nacka strand","color":["#0089ca","#ffffff"],"trips":26,"source":"SL via Trafiklab (GTFS Regional)","tts":"Piper"}